font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"margin-left:36.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >重要</font> </span></b><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >如果您的质量监控校验的表为非</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >MaxCompute表，且</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >触发方式</font></span></b><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >选择了</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >生产调度触发</font></span></b><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >，则选择的周期调度任务</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >不能使用公共调度资源组</font></span></b><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >，否则质量监控执行时将会报错。</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt 3.0000pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid