ce=3D"微软雅黑" >强规则</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#183;红色异常</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >。</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"margin-left:36.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >告警：当检测到数据质量问题后，将对该质量监控的告警订阅渠道发送告警信息。</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"margin-left:36.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >默认为：</font></span><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >强规则</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#183;红色异常</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >、</font></span><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >强规则</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#183;橙色异常</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >、</font></span><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >强规则</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#183;校验失败</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >、</font></span><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >弱规则</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#183;红色异常</font></span><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >、</font></span><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >弱规则</font><font